WEBVTT

00:10:28.499 --> 00:10:31.168
We can create more room.

00:10:31.210 --> 00:10:33.921
We can do this differently.

00:10:34.213 --> 00:10:36.090
Let's not just talk about it,

00:10:36.131 --> 00:10:37.549
let's be about it.

00:10:38.592 --> 00:10:42.054
Billie Jean King is phenomenal at this.

00:10:42.721 --> 00:10:48.018
She has been a champion of equity
on and off the court for over 50 years,

00:10:48.018 --> 00:10:50.813
mever settling for anybody’s
broke-ass anything.

00:10:50.854 --> 00:10:51.980
(Laughter)

00:10:52.606 --> 00:10:56.193
Our collaboration with Billie Jean
and the Leadership Initiative

00:10:56.235 --> 00:10:57.611
on this research

00:10:57.653 --> 00:10:59.822
is yet another example.